P-1 I21 September declaration. | Willingness evidenced by financing/declaration; executed agreements, baskets/certificate absent; feasibility demonstrated historically only. | Borrowing adds debt service without operating earnings \\u2192 reduced deleveraging flexibility and greater dependence on cash/refinancing. |\\n| G02 Shareholder extraction risk | Documentary Fact; Creditor-Adverse; null; High; Q14 | November paid, September accrued; CP-1 Ev5/E23/B14, F05. November existing cash, September debt plus cash. | Board authorization is not legal debt capacity; cash is not necessarily free liquidity. Declaration/payment/equivalents differ. | Cash/capacity allocated to equity \\u2192 monitor commitments before using gross cash as cushion. |\\n| G03 Acquisition appetite | Documentary Fact; Mixed; null; High; Q20/Q21 | Multiple FY2024 deals and prior Calspan; CP-1 Ev1/Ev2/C24, F08. | Actions establish willingness, not future debt capacity or financing access; standalone acquired EBITDA, organic bridge and realized synergies missing. | Cash/debt deployment and partial-year earnings complicate leverage \\u2192 require funding/earnings/integration bridge before pro forma debt service. |\\n| G04 Support behavior | Insufficient Information; Insufficient Information; null; Insufficient; no supporting citation | No documented stress equity injection or support undertaking established; amount/funding null. CP-1 C27 option proceeds are not rescue support. | Willingness/capacity/feasibility unestablished; need support records and ownership evidence. | No evidenced external cushion \\u2192 rely on issuer resources, not an assumption of refusal or sponsor assistance. |\\n| G05 Disclosure transparency | Insufficient Information; Insufficient Information; null; Insufficient; Q11 | Proxy-dependent ownership/related-party evidence missing; amount null. The incorporation statement documents a source boundary, not disclosure behavior. | Missing source is not reporting breach or adverse w