g was invented for unobserved owner support. Supportive reporting and mixed ordinary refinancing are not netted away against extraction.\\n\\n| Input | BF01 Debt-funded special dividend declaration | BF02 Cash-funded November distribution | BF03 Secured replacement of subordinated debt |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| documented_fact | New secured notes and Tranche L loans funded September 2024 special dividend declaration with existing cash; payment occurred October 2024. | Special dividend and eligible option dividend equivalents were paid November 27, 2023 using existing cash. | April 2024 par redemption of a subordinated note series used proceeds of March secured issuance and cash. |\\n| direction / behaviour_type / dimension | Extraction-Oriented / dividend recap / Shareholder extraction risk | Extraction-Oriented / distribution / Shareholder extraction risk | Mixed / amendment / Creditor treatment / amendment behavior |\\n| amount_funding_source | 2024-09-19: $1,500 million secured notes plus $1,500 million Tranche L term loans; total related dividend and equivalents approximately $4,348 million, remainder cash (S1 pp.42,131,146; CP-1 D13,TL05,BS14,SE02). | Approximately $2,020 million total special-dividend and equivalent payments funded by existing cash (S1 p.42); common payment component retained as CP-1 $1,937 million p.146. | $550 million subordinated notes redeemed 2024-04-22 with $550 million secured notes issued 2024-03-22 and cash (CP-1 D04,D08; S1 pp.129\\u2013130). |\\n| legal_capacity_link | Capacity: annual summary reports compliance but no executed restricted-payment baskets or certificate. Willingness: declaration documented on 2024-09-19. Feasibility: borrowing completed and cash committed historically; October payment separately dated, no forecast of repeat capacity. | Capacity untested without executed documents; willingness shown by actual 2023-11-27 cash payment; historical cash funding established, no assumption of debt tracing to this payment. |